Package: libwayland-dev
Version: @DEB_WAYLAND_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libwayland0 (= @DEB_WAYLAND_V@), libffi-dev, libexpat1-dev
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wayland.freedesktop.org
Description: Development files for the Wayland libraries
 Wayland is a protocol for a compositor to talk to its clients. This package
 contains the headers, pkg-config files, the wayland.xml/wayland.dtd protocol
 data, the wayland-scanner aclocal macros and the wayland-scanner tool needed
 to build Wayland clients and compositors.
